{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The game is currently still in active development so features, and levels may change.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The demo only features 1 out of 3 chapters that are planned, and a subset of the over 50 anomalies that will appear in the game.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Signal Intentions is an anomaly spotting game that plays out in three different chapters, each in a different area of the office, each with their own set anomalies. Does that poster always look like that? Who is that little girl? What\u2019s that sound?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Observation Horror - you may have entered what seemed like the same area, but how can you be sure that everything's the same?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666670/extras/anomaly_server_room.gif?t=1751207514\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666670/extras/normal_server_room.gif?t=1751207514\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple Areas - three different areas of the office presented in three different chapters, each with their own set of anomalies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mysterious to Assemble - uncover the truth behind the strange occurrences in the agency</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666670/extras/demo_end_footage.gif?t=1751207514\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackgro